parent_abc1_sec2	parent	Tài liệu vận hành: Hệ thống Backend OrderCore > 1. Kiến trúc tổng quan\n1. Kiến trúc tổng quan\nOrderCore là hệ thống backend xử lý đơn hàng nội bộ, gồm 5 thành phần chính.\nHệ thống OrderCore bao gồm các thành phần: Nginx (reverse proxy), Auth-Service (dịch vụ xác thực), Order-API (xử lý nghiệp vụ đơn hàng), PostgreSQL (lưu trữ dữ liệu quan hệ) và Redis (bộ nhớ đệm và hàng đợi).\nToàn bộ traffic từ client đi qua Nginx trước, sau đó được định tuyến tới Auth-Service để kiểm tra token hợp lệ trước khi request được chuyển tiếp tới Order-API.\nOrder-API không tự xác thực; nó tin tưởng hoàn toàn vào kết quả kiểm tra của Auth-Service.	\N	[0.00029520827,-0.015369075,-0.023307014,0.029442942,-0.002043802,-0.050754603,-0.027098866,0.006522562,-0.00039905604,0.027376851,-0.016364478,-0.045379035,-0.027446667,0.02956011,-0.028198691,0.05639831,-0.005131384,0.0021252572,-0.008124956,-0.010673526,-0.015309534,0.019643031,0.008171684,-0.002183438,-0.0049082586,0.034796026,-0.027581599,0.0061070113,-0.010953784,0.049951345,-0.007231403,-0.047745563,0.06252462,0.04102763,-0.02526334,-0.023987167,0.047087662,-0.048358727,-0.050405834,0.02436487,-0.014475519,-0.025288597,-0.0023919817,-0.027847301,0.007425223,-0.041325357,0.009022382,-0.005236837,-0.005926408,-0.024719818,-0.028324194,-0.034856655,0.019583331,-0.053254142,-0.050844792,0.05622609,0.002222302,0.009143712,-0.028951112,0.033190474,-0.05419102,0.010497718,-0.013054475,0.021815475,0.0128696,0.009065806,-0.001974385,0.015343433,0.006902732,-0.03678442,0.0022011856,-0.004831236,-0.049025744,0.006634031,-0.05727708,-0.002309692,0.009349344,-0.027645059,-0.008583403,-0.03284288,-0.0041061705,-0.0045029595,0.0067280675,-0.00030857732,-0.030130347,-0.012263554,-0.03528573,0.073581316,0.023055838,0.016258974,-0.020003853,-0.020192867,0.03316399,-0.018886039,-0.050738815,0.004634126,0.009355095,-0.015725939,0.048697747,0.015081274,0.01047915,-0.02854184,-0.01228303,0.0012604687,0.016312178,-0.007184957,0.03