kx_7577fdd6e427	child	Khi `pool_size` của pgbouncer bị chiếm dụng hết (100% connection đang bận), mọi truy vấn mới gửi tới sẽ phải xếp hàng chờ, và mặc định sẽ bị timeout sau 30 giây nếu không có connection nào được giải phóng.	parent_abc1_sec3	\N	{"label": "WARNING", "normalized": "Khi `pool_size` của pgbouncer bị chiếm dụng hết (100% connection đang bận), mọi truy vấn mới gửi tới sẽ phải xếp hàng chờ, và mặc định sẽ bị timeout sau 30 giây nếu không có connection nào được giải phóng."}	[]	'100':10 '30':32 'bận':13 'bị':6,29 'chiếm':7 'chờ':24 'connection':11,37 'có':36 'của':4 'dụng':8 'giây':33 'giải':40 'gửi':18 'hàng':23 'hết':9 'khi':1 'không':35 'mặc':26 'mọi':14 'mới':17 'nào':38 'nếu':34 'pgbouncer':5 'phóng':41 'phải':21 'pool':2 'sau':31 'size':3 'sẽ':20,28 'timeout':30 'truy':15 'tới':19 'và':25 'vấn':16 'xếp':22 'đang':12 'được':39 'định':27
parent_abc1_sec4	parent	Tài liệu vận hành: Hệ thống Backend OrderCore > 3. Dịch vụ xác thực (Auth-Service)\n3. Dịch vụ xác thực (Auth-Service)\nDịch vụ xác thực (Auth-Service) phát hành access token dạng JWT có thời hạn 15 phút và refresh token có thời hạn 7 ngày.\nKhi xác thực một access token, Auth-Service luôn kiểm tra Redis trước tiên để xác định token đã tồn tại trong session cache hay chưa.\nTrong trường hợp cache miss, Auth-Service sẽ truy vấn tới cơ sở dữ liệu `auth_db` trên PostgreSQL để xác minh token, sau đó lưu kết quả vào Redis để sử dụng cho các lần tiếp theo.\nNếu truy vấn tới PostgreSQL mất hơn 2 giây để phản hồi, Auth-Service sẽ coi đó là timeout và trả về mã lỗi 503 cho toàn bộ yêu cầu, bất kể trạng thái hoạt động của Order-API phía sau.	\N	[-0.03536356,-0.014094564,-0.012682231,0.00802236,-0.010203748,-0.015343547,0.014130984,0.0023153184,-0.0032462364,0.0067912396,0.01129672,0.004393792,0.018544193,0.0040068626,0.017953994,0.01120517,0.0029152173,0.0028964651,0.02887852,0.02608003,-0.020682845,0.0006658423,-0.0013718373,0.0075741005,0.0025259499,-0.0015345889,-0.032858204,-0.0026868288,0.07428286,0.02950892,0.029568652,-0.037632972,0.022579314,0.024944842,-0.047612406,-0.012171408,-0.005745314,-0.033406682,-0.049765993,0.05569699,-0.019585302,-0.034683585,0.021965459,-0.024988713,-0.0072160796,-0.02456912,0.00026253224,0.005998938,0.00567465,0.006129097,-0.0033134292,-0.0045755766,0.031100199,-0.03394278,-0.0045955647,0.049584698,0.02390989,-0.004995513,-0.02584618,0.0013525555,0.0069541866,0.018599344,-0.019789629,0.029399043,-0.02724946,0.05327026,-0.0055142976,-0.0042330245,0.010759612,-0.047697227,0.011737319,0.014470008,-0.046469238,0.029154526,-0.041384608,0.033165414,0.041832246,0.04721487,0.037591603,-0.0019983128,0.012110231,-0.005531869,0.003854404,0.03650571,-0.041565377,-0.017864142,-0.023464352,0.017792856,0.012885271,0.046959102,-0.012060958,-0.0056223786,0.024696019,-0.03345461,-0.017324444,0.027641306,-0.036225647,-0.016086185,0.0