parent_abc1_sec7	parent	Tài liệu vận hành: Hệ thống Backend OrderCore > 6. Chính sách sao lưu\n6. Chính sách sao lưu\nHệ thống sao lưu cơ sở dữ liệu PostgreSQL tự động bằng công cụ `pg_dump` vào lúc 2:00 sáng hàng ngày.\nFile backup sau khi nén sẽ được tải lên S3 bucket có tên `ordercore-backups`.\nCác bản backup được giữ lại trong 30 ngày trước khi tự động bị xóa theo chính sách lifecycle của bucket.\nĐội vận hành thực hiện diễn tập khôi phục (restore drill) mỗi quý một lần để đảm bảo rằng các file backup có thể sử dụng được cho việc khôi phục dữ liệu khi cần thiết, chứ không chỉ đơn thuần tồn tại trên S3.	\N	[-0.052478492,-0.030038113,-0.016323425,0.0013917672,-0.027998399,-0.056180395,0.022723604,0.011380965,0.005206885,0.0018955071,-0.011696718,-0.012437025,-0.012873067,0.015019643,0.06699795,0.023751555,-0.016857106,-0.0040729656,0.009008376,-0.02760064,0.008476799,-0.014657751,0.060268473,0.040995065,-0.017351355,-0.0066481563,-0.037691515,0.017047236,-0.0034139361,0.060381144,-0.0028178578,-0.00013705305,-0.0033995546,0.011637874,-0.05045543,0.0060295053,-0.003852994,-0.036959007,-0.0433357,0.03174569,-0.020431148,-0.024123425,0.03475547,-0.017371623,0.011694923,0.0014079515,0.021474559,-0.019355724,0.03133436,-0.0285922,-0.005367124,-0.015369976,0.022489158,-0.05460151,0.02622431,0.061865304,-0.022969447,-0.012342744,-0.019667786,0.01310237,-0.0074435733,-0.015225988,0.014661296,-0.0028936886,0.010373015,0.046101857,0.034465283,0.017981302,0.005187982,-0.01667777,0.01408111,0.03344165,-0.037344586,-0.009500164,-0.08225735,0.037270065,0.031687252,0.006424021,0.016316218,-0.018013265,0.02433834,-0.025224933,0.04293968,-0.001004149,-0.010119437,0.040049117,-0.026660547,0.111238316,0.016777398,0.011118936,0.021473369,-0.015439592,0.0049515665,-0.052361637,-0.04789098,-0.0025865112,0.04810202,-0.018817702,0.011315403,0.018995361,0.016232047,-0.011009818,0.024702048,-0.016895402,0.032683913,-0.01236286,0.035381306,-0.025162278,-0.0039466624,-0.018149922,-0.0043235