parent_abc1_sec8	parent	Tài liệu vận hành: Hệ thống Backend OrderCore > 7. Quy trình xử lý sự cố\n7. Quy trình xử lý sự cố\nKhi cảnh báo `pgbouncer_pool_used_percent` vượt 80%, đội on-call nhận được cảnh báo.\nBước đầu tiên trong quy trình là kiểm tra log của Auth-Service xem có phải nguyên nhân đến từ việc Redis vừa khởi động lại hoặc mất kết nối.\nNếu nguyên nhân đến từ Redis, giải pháp tạm thời là tăng `pool_size` của pgbouncer lên 100 trong lúc chờ Redis ổn định trở lại.\nNếu nguyên nhân không liên quan tới Redis, bước tiếp theo là kiểm tra các truy vấn chậm (slow query) đang chạy trong `orders_db`.	\N	[-0.04948517,0.00021502105,-0.056006134,0.0054418826,-0.032813586,-0.014180818,0.009131961,0.027959945,0.020978086,0.023361873,-0.0043554716,0.002434587,0.032120515,0.036911957,0.05225838,-0.024575742,0.027468147,0.023731843,0.025333269,0.010024176,0.05994596,0.02239404,0.014608367,0.037177484,-0.021994073,0.018728187,-0.015686749,-0.024572624,0.04549632,0.023361452,0.035312805,-0.012965464,-0.0017490985,-0.014153813,-0.023111472,-0.0006322248,0.029945958,-0.056089617,-0.03584846,0.026535742,-0.0058714016,-0.03333113,0.0058833677,-0.0045092185,0.018184574,-0.026834851,0.0038452675,-0.017975787,0.0025564488,-0.0007149339,-0.01982063,-0.006717497,0.039223567,-0.06036326,-0.018175047,0.05673176,0.035523165,-0.00827871,-0.021059716,0.02824306,-0.059935648,-0.006633501,-0.044286158,-0.025870217,0.014979217,0.09171095,-0.03155762,0.029236738,-0.023173116,-0.036873847,-0.019531852,0.03664271,-0.015776763,-0.008039463,-0.07181853,0.012561888,0.06485447,-0.016357433,0.039288793,-0.0137915695,0.009462924,-0.017290281,-0.015684277,0.016406273,-0.032043822,0.0111897085,-0.0072426074,0.003089743,0.0025302393,0.010953154,0.03853942,-0.015697163,0.007542681,-0.03598913,-0.009095934,0.04410315,0.03301879,-0.012692932,0.03564565,-0.0032161537,-0.0049711936,-0.034847505,0.0018021058,-0.049885206,0.04339905,0.041896295,0.049333777,0.026281822,0.012317315,-0.014007637,-0.0059133153,-