parent_abc1_sec9	parent	Tài liệu vận hành: Hệ thống Backend OrderCore > 8. Triển khai (Deployment)\n8. Triển khai (Deployment)\nOrderCore triển khai chiến lược blue-green deployment\nphiên bản mới triển khai song song với phiên bản cũ\n10% traffic được chuyển sang bản mới (canary) trong 15 phút đầu tiên để theo dõi\nNếu trong giai đoạn canary, Prometheus phát ra cảnh báo mức "critical" liên quan tới service vừa được triển khai\npipeline CI/CD tự động rollback về phiên bản cũ ngay lập tức\nScript khởi động của Auth-Service chạy lệnh xoá toàn bộ dữ liệu Redis (FLUSHDB) trước khi khởi động\nmục đích là tránh việc dùng nhầm các session token đã được cache theo định dạng cũ	\N	[-0.028770056,-0.03810277,-0.058034804,0.00851525,-0.041177336,-0.012732776,0.005214368,0.03214332,0.031733785,0.038791925,-0.016105177,0.0020670777,0.011244657,0.010767346,0.015503331,-0.02208524,0.029887808,0.04593647,0.035840932,-0.003026383,0.02131227,0.0125591615,0.013456022,0.060143,0.00058960164,0.067770384,-0.022667544,-0.0108905425,0.02382572,0.07925443,0.028867042,0.026611352,-0.035342194,0.0054176254,-0.022777453,-0.024388986,0.016337018,-0.026514519,-0.058980368,0.016987257,-0.0056633544,-0.030573588,-0.0066422024,0.03928335,0.05979712,-0.060246393,0.041082673,-0.01891124,0.01996482,-0.019058555,0.0001220774,-0.041539673,0.033492174,-0.07025974,0.038444843,0.034973864,-0.012056965,-0.022016034,-0.008571619,0.0018434321,-0.04736244,-0.04689087,0.015748022,-0.020491404,-0.024604075,0.03807351,-0.006381946,0.008743195,0.0190835,-0.020920482,-0.039453574,0.024278805,0.007829446,-0.00068619475,-0.065319136,0.0034049754,0.034356803,0.004556413,0.02577719,0.015506298,0.007069856,-0.011392083,-0.030952668,0.031384397,0.027296666,-0.025659492,-0.011593778,0.048862685,0.029900068,0.018544126,0.0085634645,0.005867479,0.017116211,-0.050483484,-0.009749524,-0.029868256,-0.0038953798,-0.021454971,0.025411678,0.017816618,0.0063063395,-0.03213745,-0.0033058228,-0.033697892,0.0019527273,0.024387782,0.03