community_abc1_0	community	Cụm này tập trung vào cấu trúc và cơ chế hoạt động của dịch vụ xác thực (Auth-Service), bao gồm cách nó quản lý token và tương tác với cơ sở dữ liệu. Auth-Service sử dụng PostgreSQL chung với Order-API nhưng có database logic riêng (`auth_db`) và lưu trữ token trong Redis để tăng hiệu suất. Khi cần xác minh token, service sẽ kiểm tra Redis trước, nếu không có thì truy vấn đến `auth_db`. Trong trường hợp truy vấn PostgreSQL vượt quá 2 giây, Auth-Service sẽ trả về lỗi 503.	\N	[-0.041499693,-0.019282041,-0.02279153,0.014352225,-0.02362334,0.014153294,-0.015886316,0.00794367,0.006213317,0.009718481,-0.024492474,-0.019839384,0.03887813,0.02160617,0.011564646,2.1797498e-05,-0.022365686,0.0018605336,0.017808914,0.01383777,0.0010688555,0.024371644,-0.011599944,0.012781808,0.00018037381,0.01372081,-0.023016818,0.010073009,0.04590893,0.015667662,0.01584493,-0.047043588,0.0049303398,0.014306407,-0.046867445,-0.013051965,0.0047051637,-0.032650623,-0.04564001,0.028805254,0.019583475,-0.020782089,0.018663378,-0.035992883,0.0054798806,-0.030699296,0.008399803,-0.0051153754,-0.0039530215,0.013092515,-0.0045824973,-0.03446571,0.03174059,-0.027355915,-0.022493927,0.06051642,0.010209636,0.0059044613,-0.039922234,-0.001428728,-0.022033602,0.00090747804,-0.019868799,0.0069051837,-0.02475382,0.044273935,-0.019203011,0.0059158276,0.0043248516,-0.05221732,0.011653256,0.03493717,-0.06635782,0.040130585,-0.040035777,0.0373408,0.007542978,0.033574875,0.015077547,-0.006612195,-0.0055848835,0.010765685,-0.0044804458,4.2857413e-05,-0.04494035,-0.011605061,-0.02389591,0.017740406,0.027170097,0.057153553,0.00457346,0.0037734092,0.061650503,-0.025546845,-0.006867701,-0.009875927,0.01692577,0.016589776,0.034875378,0.019119337,0.007820072,-0.048597347,-0.028819311,-0.024928182,0.05080302,0.016155364,0.08279386,0.00022330355,0.006105186,-0.011172067,-7.634625e-05,0.019566137,0.015129939,0.0024795884,-0.005501383,-0.034152832,-0.0072122673,0.0066929786,0.012027698,-0.00333820