community_abc1_2	community	Cụm này nói về quy trình triển khai phần mềm an toàn và tự động. Chiến lược blue-green deployment được sử dụng để tránh lỗi tương thích session token, trong đó phiên bản mới được triển khai song song và chỉ nhận 10% traffic trong 15 phút đầu (canary deployment). Hệ thống giám sát Prometheus sẽ kích hoạt rollback tự động nếu có cảnh báo critical trong giai đoạn này. Trước khi khởi động, Auth-Service cũng tự động xóa cache Redis để đảm bảo môi trường sạch.	\N	[-0.036290895,-0.012774968,-0.04391239,0.008305403,-0.04944307,0.009035212,0.014772098,0.049409002,0.042936444,0.043589104,-0.031828128,0.043211725,-0.0012272386,0.03322923,0.03163789,-0.01258403,0.020344825,0.027333684,0.03572497,-0.002374911,0.03873444,0.02763136,-0.0050747544,0.015985562,0.007051574,0.06767883,-0.03605641,0.010715797,0.01650569,0.06611102,0.006030305,0.032396935,-0.047699615,-0.00037149488,-0.011155625,-0.041595355,-0.012200178,-0.07525118,-0.04049396,0.021058582,0.005727763,-0.051332362,0.012960788,0.00736074,0.0683456,-0.054173693,0.028980955,-0.026922526,-0.024065351,-0.00041015178,0.009925363,-0.032738276,0.019354604,-0.067288235,0.017705413,0.021320187,0.022191329,-0.0014162132,-0.011901049,0.0076149045,-0.048744507,-0.017011685,0.01305764,-0.023880735,-0.012732316,0.026750902,-0.021887107,-0.016800426,0.027337093,-0.049095523,-0.03139681,0.012288968,0.0065953415,-0.0072106784,-0.057799198,0.00027201715,0.011117881,0.0018053992,0.0016978,0.012414819,0.0056650736,0.008517508,-0.042625237,0.028235244,0.010072775,-0.02012311,-0.025412276,0.06354098,0.039034847,0.007832414,0.009100432,0.0054720948,0.032360505,-0.041742627,-0.020300545,-0.022588853,-0.013503365,-0.023016352,0.04151861,0.0126633495,0.007640029,-0.029735642,-0.01896098,-0.02169808,0.046867613,0.045135707,0.053708367,0.026846347,-0.010428905,-0.008569937,0.0151365865,-0.006745077,-0.046182647,-0.0015438937,-0.022572588,-0.034092195,0.014734309,-0.0025090447,-0.0033309609,-0.0006056659,0.015290954,0.0426