community_abc1_3	community	Hệ thống OrderCore là một kiến trúc backend xử lý đơn hàng nội bộ, bao gồm 5 thành phần chính: Nginx đóng vai trò reverse proxy, Auth-Service chịu trách nhiệm xác thực token, Order-API xử lý logic nghiệp vụ đơn hàng, cùng với PostgreSQL và Redis để lưu trữ dữ liệu và quản lý bộ nhớ đệm. Toàn bộ traffic từ client đều đi qua Nginx và được kiểm tra xác thực bởi Auth-Service trước khi được chuyển tiếp đến Order-API. Order-API không tự thực hiện xác thực mà hoàn toàn tin tưởng vào kết quả từ Auth-Service.	\N	[-0.01687103,-0.026151344,-0.0121147,0.027358226,-0.010395775,-0.04099205,-0.011094831,0.003803782,-0.006788994,0.026016809,-0.005222645,-0.04309085,-0.026782203,0.024210745,-0.010431346,0.046535082,0.005093823,-0.013190892,0.0028413276,-0.023347013,-0.026976686,0.013005511,-0.0017021587,0.017061947,-0.00039689956,0.037506655,-0.021677682,0.016510032,0.0015220321,0.03224401,-0.0148898745,-0.042147353,0.048231166,0.04932803,-0.037413526,-0.0037360252,0.04259069,-0.04490783,-0.049617928,0.011100639,-0.0016386696,-0.03268863,-0.0012517595,-0.024794273,0.010589381,-0.049026977,-0.00031254065,-0.0016649397,0.0021106992,-0.024007276,-0.039111175,-0.047184892,0.026349436,-0.049902253,-0.040611543,0.06296509,0.006859437,0.0030908645,-0.02566864,0.013426713,-0.0357317,-0.007877068,-0.014786556,0.027048808,-0.0005964716,0.018066214,-0.012580406,0.030459452,-0.0038273663,-0.051044878,-0.0137275765,0.018141972,-0.0514725,0.017299412,-0.062192608,0.020132324,0.01961736,-0.014258173,0.00878114,-0.028693613,0.005550473,-0.022917151,-0.019216577,-0.005716318,-0.018770382,-0.008709598,-0.03456481,0.050575957,0.01976103,0.019391943,-0.025366511,-0.020752255,0.021899022,-0.032805305,-0.047404084,-0.003880062,0.014558501,-0.008088715,0.03917895,0.01529051,0.0033962918,-0.036900148,-0.008822371,-0.017044967,0.020277165,0.0018754853,0.022056313,-0.0040524206,-0.031156644,-0.02264905,0.029233662,0.019042788,-0.0013290788,0.013497325,0.01442788,-0.06547244,0.00446