community_abc1_6	community	Khi cảnh báo sử dụng pool của pgbouncer vượt quá 80%, đội on-call sẽ được thông báo và bắt đầu quy trình xử lý sự cố. Bước đầu tiên là kiểm tra log của Auth-Service để xác định nguyên nhân, đặc biệt là do Redis khởi động lại hoặc mất kết nối. Nếu đúng là do Redis, giải pháp tạm thời là tăng pool_size của pgbouncer lên 100. Trường hợp không phải do Redis, đội vận hành sẽ tiếp tục kiểm tra các truy vấn chậm trong cơ sở dữ liệu orders_db.	\N	[-0.03831659,-0.023562454,-0.05272279,0.009429457,-0.034385182,-0.00676769,0.0010003035,0.0068018367,0.012166069,0.030403271,-0.013027528,-0.0019753154,0.02381887,0.037625495,0.073697194,-0.018516967,0.009178565,0.016458163,0.02091275,0.014833661,0.05157845,0.03192666,-0.015266163,0.041131224,-0.021728106,0.020905828,-0.040226016,-0.0026589695,0.04416373,0.026077185,0.030806687,-0.027139116,0.003911907,-0.026929582,-0.02755748,0.0013265499,0.038105827,-0.06497379,-0.024668898,0.012477037,-0.0034413238,-0.027621277,0.0025350838,-0.022250604,0.032051757,-0.01683189,0.013101567,-0.008935192,-0.0011717684,-0.016318252,-0.020954063,-0.009126404,0.03487538,-0.048606336,-0.025196288,0.06337634,0.0761103,-0.015940053,-0.004691513,0.009144006,-0.050370503,0.00091570057,-0.049864464,-0.038421,0.0031420167,0.08823517,-0.026776552,0.014028427,-0.0290246,-0.040260766,-0.010071078,0.045770127,-0.041275203,0.016717779,-0.06547929,0.013881971,0.05730814,-0.019518778,0.03134313,-0.030938052,0.014879042,-0.030367522,-0.019087456,0.0063304794,-0.05454775,-0.0001669371,0.023628397,-0.009268872,0.0026745284,0.036534254,0.048137296,-0.006181623,0.0099141365,-0.037533063,-0.0031485173,0.021021323,0.026618415,-0.016362125,0.04170712,-0.013616601,0.007676991,-0.028023066,-0.0146896485,-0.041803494,0.029731816,0.053078152,0.044699717,0.028464627,0.0053682965,-0.016824009,-0.020463355,-0.005257539,0.0032392605,-0.0038583572,-0.022751747,-0.004548635,-0.04589936,0.025190234,-0.028888198,-0.040450204,0.008267761,0.022364844,0.0313549